{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40866","headline":"赠妓人王福娘 · 孙棨","name":"赠妓人王福娘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩翠仙衣红玉肤，轻盈年在破瓜初。\n霞杯醉劝刘郎赌，云髻慵邀阿母梳。\n不怕寒侵缘带宝，每忧风举倩持裾。\n谩图西子晨粧样，西子元来未得如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}